Consider the following scenario:

- There are 100 assets in the market.
- When the [`deposit`](https://github.com/code-423n4/2024-08-wildcat/blob/fe746cc0fbedc4447a981a50e6ba4c95f98b9fe1/src/market/WildcatMarket.sol#L55) function is called to deposit an additional 100 assets, interest is accrued—let's assume it's 10 assets. This leaves 90 assets available for withdrawal requests (if any exist).

